<title>USA: P&amp;G has 31.6 pct Regeneron stake.</title>
<headline>P&amp;G has 31.6 pct Regeneron stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Procter &amp; Gamble Co on Thursday reported holding the equivalent of a 31.6 percent stake or 6.6 million shares in Regeneron Pharmaceutical Inc., which includes warrants.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Procter &amp; Gamble said it acquired the stake as part of the terms of a securities purchase agreement with Regeneron reached last month.</p>
<p>Under that pact Procter &amp; Gamble agreed to pay Regeneron $135 million over five years as part of a collaboration to discover, develop and commercialize certain pharmaceutical products.</p>
</text>
